          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Vertebrate animals generally have a myelin sheath around the axons of motor neurones.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 23
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Explain why the presence of a myelin sheath around a motor neurone axon is an advantage.",
